{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12630","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12630/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12630/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12630/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12630","id":3152283480,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc675AdY","number":12630,"title":"Agent makes changes to old version of file","user":{"login":"BramVanroy","id":2779410,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3Nzk0MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2779410?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy","html_url":"https://github.com/BramVanroy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BramVanroy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-06-17T06:51:03Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:46:33Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:46:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Agent mode will sometimes not use the most recent version of a file and instead seemingly using an old cached version, and edit that. In my case this has led to **destructive** behavior where I simply lost recent updates to code because it was all overwritten by the cached version with some edits here and there.\n\nMy guess is that the most recent version of a file is not correctly uploaded or included when sending it to the API. So the API is re-using some older cache for context.\n\n- Copilot Chat Extension Version: 0.28.0\n- VS Code Version: 1.101.1\n- OS Version: Windows 11 24H2 **but using remote development via SSH**\n- Feature (e.g. agent/edit/ask mode): agent mode\n- Selected model (e.g. GPT 4.1, Claude 3.7 Sonnet): any remote, API-based model\n- Logs: could not find the logs?\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. work on a repository (git-enabled) over SSH on a linux remote\n2. use agent mode often and `git add .` from time to time\n3. after a while the agent mode will make changes to a file from the cache rather than the last update file, removing recent changes to the file\n","closed_by":{"login":"bhavyaus","id":25044782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ0Nzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25044782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus","html_url":"https://github.com/bhavyaus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavy